WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.900 line:78% position:50% align:center
This block is one billion dollars.

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:07.200 line:78% position:50% align:center
In $100 bills, that means
10 million notes.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:11.450 line:78% position:50% align:center
10,000 notes make
one million dollars.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.300 line:78% position:50% align:center
A billion needs 1,000
stacks like this.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:21.300 line:78% position:50% align:center
Together, they weigh
about 10 metric tons.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:30.400 line:78% position:50% align:center
The column climbs roughly 1.1 kilometers—
higher than the Burj Khalifa.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.600 line:78% position:50% align:center
10 million pieces of paper.
One billion dollars.
